        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The player controls the character (an adventurer) in a combination of combat and puzzle game elements. The player typically has to navigate the character through a long series of tests, trials and mazes to reach goals. The end goal is to reach the evil warlock in his mountain fortress.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El jugador controla al personaje (un aventurero) en una combinación de combate y elementos de rompecabezas. Normalmente, el jugador debe guiar al personaje a través de una larga serie de pruebas, desafíos y laberintos para alcanzar sus objetivos. La meta final es llegar al malvado brujo en su fortaleza de montaña.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
